## 3 More Lab Picks — 1.5ct D-FL Under $5,000

Pick 7 gives you a lab 2ct for $4,990. These three picks give you a lab 1.5ct at different price points and in three different settings — all verified against current IGI-certified inventory.

The 1.5ct stone is 7.4mm face-up. That is 14% wider than a 1ct natural stone (6.5mm). For comparison, a natural 1.5ct GIA stone starts at approximately $12,000 in certified inventory. These picks give you the same 7.4mm face-up for under $5,000.

All three use IGI D-FL 1.50ct Ideal cut round stones. D color is colorless. FL is Flawless — zero inclusions at any magnification. For a lab stone, D-FL is the highest grade available. At $3,390, these stones are priced correctly for IGI D-FL at 1.5ct.

